-- en: "Matches when Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests this spell as the next cast. An override counts as its base spell, and the base spell as its override. With no spell chosen, matches whenever Assisted Combat suggests anything."
L["Matches when Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests this spell as the next cast. An override counts as its base spell, and the base spell as its override. With no spell chosen, matches whenever Assisted Combat suggests anything."] = "Se cumple cuando el Asistente de combate de Blizzard sugiere este hechizo como el siguiente que lanzar. Una sustitución cuenta como su hechizo base, y el hechizo base como su sustitución. Si no se elige ningún hechizo, se cumple siempre que el Asistente de combate sugiera algo."
-- en: "Assisted Combat exists on Retail (and is declared on Forever). Where the game does not offer it, for this character or specialization, or the suggestion cannot be read, this condition is unavailable rather than false, including under NOT."
L["Assisted Combat exists on Retail (and is declared on Forever). Where the game does not offer it, for this character or specialization, or the suggestion cannot be read, this condition is unavailable rather than false, including under NOT."] = "El Asistente de combate existe en Retail (y está declarado en Forever). Donde el juego no lo ofrece, para este personaje o especialización, o no se puede leer la sugerencia, esta condición no está disponible en lugar de ser falsa, también bajo NOT."
