L["Opens the talent tree of the rotation's specialization. Click a talent to choose it for this condition."] = "Abre el árbol de talentos de la especialización de la rotación. Haz clic en un talento para elegirlo en esta condición."
-- en: "Show talent tree draws the talent tree of the specialization shown, with every talent open to choose. Click a talent to choose it, or click the chosen one again to clear it; the Talent list follows. It cannot open during combat."
L["Show talent tree draws the talent tree of the specialization shown, with every talent open to choose. Click a talent to choose it, or click the chosen one again to clear it; the Talent list follows. It cannot open during combat."] = "Mostrar árbol de talentos dibuja el árbol de talentos de la especialización mostrada, con todos los talentos disponibles para elegir. Haz clic en un talento para elegirlo, o en el elegido para quitarlo; la lista de talentos lo sigue. No se puede abrir durante el combate."
-- en: "Forever is the exception: Talent tree is one of the three talent trees of your active loadout (in the order the talent window shows them); their points are read again after any talent change. Retail has no such trees."
